SUMMARY:Free Butterfly & Flower Photography at Scadding Cabin
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Photography Group\n## About the event -link to sig
 n up- [https://www.wtpg.ngo/event-details/scading-cabin-photographing-butt
 erflies-and-flowers-during-cne ](https://www.wtpg.ngo/event-details/scadin
 g-cabin-photographing-butterflies-and-flowers-during-cne)\n\n# Free Butter
 fly & Flower Photography at Scadding Cabin\n\n**Join us at Scadding Cabin 
 this August for a FREE presentation and photography event!**\nCome explore
  the beautiful gardens at historic Scadding Cabin as we photograph **butte
 rflies\, flowers and the incredible details of summer in the garden.** Bri
 ng your camera\, your macro lens—or simply your smartphone—and join us
  for a fun\, relaxed photography session.\n📍 **Scadding Cabin at Exhibi
 tion Place**\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1eaf19_de06f0a742dc46
 aba15ed7a9c000c6e7~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1018\,h_830\,al_c\,q_90\,enc_auto/1ea
 f19_de06f0a742dc46aba15ed7a9c000c6e7~mv2.png)\n📅 **This August during t
 he CNE 2pm-4pm on August 29th and Sept 3rd**\n![](https://static.wixstatic
 .com/media/1eaf19_a48453499d124edab49f193980186506~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_497\,
 h_497\,al_c\,lg_1\,q_80\,enc_auto/1eaf19_a48453499d124edab49f193980186506~
 mv2.jpg)\n📸 **Free photography event & presentation**\n\n**Please note:
 ** This event takes place during the CNE\, so **CNE admission is required*
 * to access the grounds and attend the event. CNE tickets are available on
 line or at the gate.\nCome out\, meet fellow photographers\, enjoy the gar
 dens and capture some beautiful summer images!\n[#WestTorontoPhotographyGr
 oup](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#WestTorontoPhotographyGro
 up) [#WTPG](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#WTPG) [#ScaddingCa
 bin](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#ScaddingCabin) [#CNE2026]
 (https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#CNE2026) [#TorontoPhotography
 ](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#TorontoPhotography) [#Photog
 raphyWorkshop](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#PhotographyWork
 shop) [#ButterflyPhotography](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/posts?query=%23#
 ButterflyPhotography) [#FlowerPhotography](https://www.wtpg.ngo/search/pos
 ts?query=%23#FlowerPhotography) [#MacroPhotography](https://www.wtpg.ngo/s
 earch/posts?query=%23#MacroPhotography) [#TorontoEvents](https://www.wtpg.
 ngo/search/posts?query=%23#TorontoEvents)
